{"id":"kategoricheski","lemma":"категорически","pos":"adv","rank":4908,"glosses":["categorically","flatly, strongly, out of hand"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я категорически против этого.","en":"I'm completely against it.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"against"},null]},{"text":"Том был категорически против этой идеи.","en":"Tom was dead set against the idea.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"against"},null,{"g":"idea, thought, notion","l":"идея"}]},{"text":"Я с этим категорически не согласен.","en":"I completely disagree with that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"with / from"},null,null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Он категорически отказался впустить меня.","en":"He flatly refused to let me in.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to abandon","l":"отказаться"},{"g":"to let in, to admit"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Я категорически не согласен с тем, что ты сказал.","en":"I strongly disagree with what you said.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"}]}]}